.Dv KVM_MSR_FILTER_DEFAULT_DENY
with no range;
.Dv KVM_CAP_X86_USER_SPACE_MSR
or
.Dv KVM_CAP_X2APIC_API
of a bit it does not name; and, under
.Dv KVM_X2APIC_API_USE_32BIT_IDS ,
.Dv KVM_SET_LAPIC
of another x2APIC id and an MSI with bits 7:0 of its high address set.
.It Bq Er E2BIG
A list longer than the call takes, more than 256 CPUID entries or 256
MSRs or more;
.Dv KVM_GET_SUPPORTED_HV_CPUID
with room for fewer than ten entries; or a buffer too small for the list asked for, whose count
.Dv KVM_GET_MSR_INDEX_LIST
and
.Dv KVM_GET_MSR_FEATURE_INDEX_LIST
